{
  "declaredLength": 7396,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Quel heureux hasard de tomber sur vous,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C00200068006500750072006500750078002000680061007300610072006400200064006500200074006F006D006200650072002000730075007200200076006F00750073002C000A001000020100000000200021001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis ici pour conclure un marché.\nVous pouvez y assister si le cœur vous en dit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous voilà.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0075007300200076006F0069006C00E0002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Commençons immédiatement les négociations,\nvous voulez bien ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065006E00E7006F006E007300200069006D006D00E900640069006100740065006D0065006E00740020006C006500730020006E00E90067006F00630069006100740069006F006E0073002C000A0076006F0075007300200076006F0075006C0065007A0020006200690065006E0020003F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’apport financier de Quazar est insuffisant pour\ncouvrir les coûts d’exploration d’Extra Illumis.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Conformément à l’accord initial que nous avons\nsigné, notre matériel est à votre disposition.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela va sans dire, la recherche et le développement\ndudit matériel ont un coût non négligeable.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien entendu, nous savons tout cela.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais les objets d’étude sont très nombreux,\net nos coûts de main-d’œuvre sont supérieurs<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naux estimations initiales.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos gars bossent sans arrêt. Un coup d’pouce\nfinancier nous aiderait à graisser les engrenages.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous comprenez qu’une réestimation du budget\ndevra faire l’objet de longues tractations.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous avons bien conscience que votre société\ndoit également gérer le réaménagement d’Illumis.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Or, l’importance de ces explorations pour\nce réaménagement ne vous aura pas échappé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On bosse tous pour Illumis, mais si on continue\ncomme ça, on va droit dans l’mur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi ne pas régler ça avec\nun combat Pokémon ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F00690020006E006500200070006100730020007200E90067006C00650072002000E7006100200061007600650063000A0075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020003F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela me convient.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPermettez-moi de choisir <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\ncomme associé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe dans cette négociation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comptez sur moi.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D007000740065007A00200073007500720020006D006F0069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Quoi ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F002000510075006F00690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ainsi va le monde des affaires. Vous ne voulez pas\nfaire attendre Monsieur Corvault, n’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma réputation est en jeu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610020007200E9007000750074006100740069006F006E002000650073007400200065006E0020006A00650075002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si on veut régler nos comptes avec Musquat,\nva falloir s’battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006F006E002000760065007500740020007200E90067006C006500720020006E006F007300200063006F006D0070007400650073002000610076006500630020004D007500730071007500610074002C000A00760061002000660061006C006C006F006900720020007320190062006100740074007200650020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais tout faire pour gagner.\nLa réputation de mon boss est en jeu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007600610069007300200074006F0075007400200066006100690072006500200070006F007500720020006700610067006E00650072002E000A004C00610020007200E9007000750074006100740069006F006E0020006400650020006D006F006E00200062006F00730073002000650073007400200065006E0020006A00650075002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Encore un instant !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0063006F0072006500200075006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sérieux ?! Grouille-toi, qu’on en finisse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300E9007200690065007500780020003F0021002000470072006F00750069006C006C0065002D0074006F0069002C0020007100752019006F006E00200065006E002000660069006E00690073007300650020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Assez de bla-bla ! On passe à l’action !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300730065007A00200064006500200062006C0061002D0062006C0061002000210020004F006E002000700061007300730065002000E00020006C20190061006300740069006F006E0020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Clan Dérouillard ne fait pas travailler les gens\ngratuitement. Nous avons un honneur à défendre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne vous ferai pas de cadeau. Après tout, je dois\naussi défendre la réputation de mon boss !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il serait impoli de les faire attendre davantage.\nCommençons vite ce combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brutapode ! Je compte sur toi !\nOn va retourner la situation, à l’aise !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Airmure ! Méga-évolue et montre-toi\ndans toute ta splendeur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100690072006D007500720065002000210020004D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C007500650020006500740020006D006F006E007400720065002D0074006F0069000A00640061006E007300200074006F007500740065002000740061002000730070006C0065006E00640065007500720020002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Draïeul et moi sommes en parfaite symbiose !\nÀ nous la Méga-Évolution !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous n’avez pas volé votre réputation. J’aurais\nperdu si <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ne m’avait pas aidé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une défaite, c’est une défaite !\nOublions cette histoire de coûts pour l’moment.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous contribuerons comme nous le pourrons\nen réduisant nos frais personnels.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Croyez-moi lorsque je dis que je reconnais le rôle\nprimordial que vos explorations ont pour nous.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe ferai en sorte qu’une nouvelle proposition de\nbudget soit validée dans les plus brefs délais.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 202
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En attendant, j’paierai les membres de not’ clan\nde ma poche.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200061007400740065006E00640061006E0074002C0020006A201900700061006900650072006100690020006C006500730020006D0065006D00620072006500730020006400650020006E006F0074201900200063006C0061006E000A006400650020006D006100200070006F006300680065002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et pour toi, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, un p’tit cadeau !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200070006F0075007200200074006F0069002C00200010000201000000002C00200075006E00200070201900740069007400200063006100640065006100750020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez un costume de Corvault d’une autre\ncouleur !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A00200075006E00200063006F007300740075006D006500200064006500200043006F0072007600610075006C00740020006420190075006E0065002000610075007400720065000A0063006F0075006C006500750072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En plus de ça, tu peux t’faire la même coupe\nque moi au salon d’coiffure, si ça te chante !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Musquat. Je compte sur not’ collaboration pour\naméliorer l’état de cette ville.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlus elle attirera les foules, plus l’argent coulera\nà flots !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est entendu.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNous espérons que cette coopération renforcera\nles liens entre notre société et le Clan Dérouillard.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai beau voir cette ville changer, j’la kiffe\ntoujours autant. Je l’ai dans la peau.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette ville a accepté le jeune voyou que j’étais.\nJe lui dois tout.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065007400740065002000760069006C006C006500200061002000610063006300650070007400E90020006C00650020006A00650075006E006500200076006F0079006F007500200071007500650020006A201900E90074006100690073002E000A004A00650020006C0075006900200064006F0069007300200074006F00750074002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Monsieur Corvault possède ses propres\nconvictions... et j’ai les miennes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    }
  ],
